  "grammar_explanations": [
    {
      "slug": "want + infinitive: affirmative (I want to ...) and questions (Do you want to ...?)",
      "title_form": "Querer + infinitivo: afirmativo y preguntas",
      "title_target": "Want + Infinitive: Affirmative and Questions",
      "description_md_form": "Para expresar un deseo, usamos **want to** + verbo en infinitivo. La estructura es simple: **sujeto + want to + verbo**. Por ejemplo: *I want to eat a salad.* (Quiero comer una ensalada).\n\nPara preguntar sobre los deseos de otra persona, usamos **Do you want to...?** al inicio de la pregunta. Por ejemplo: *Do you want to drink coffee?* (¿Quieres beber café?).\n\n**Importante:** el verbo después de *want to* siempre va en su forma base (sin *to* adicional ni cambios). No decimos *I want to eating* ni *I want eat*. La forma *want to* es fija para todas las personas: I, you, we, they.",
      "description_md_target": "To express a wish, we use **want to** + verb in the infinitive. The structure is simple: **subject + want to + verb**. For example: *I want to eat a salad.*\n\nTo ask about someone's wishes, we use **Do you want to...?** at the start of the question. For example: *Do you want to drink coffee?*\n\n**Important:** the verb after *want to* always goes in its base form. We don't say *I want to eating* or *I want eat*. The form *want to* is fixed for all persons: I, you, we, they.",
      "grammar_structure": "Subject + want to + base verb (affirmative) / Do + subject + want to + base verb? (question)",
      "conjugation_table": {
        "name": "want_to_present",
        "headers": [
          "Pronombre",
          "Afirmativo",
          "Pregunta"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "I",
            "I want to eat.",
            "Do I want to eat?"
          ],
          [
            "You",
            "You want to drink.",
            "Do you want to drink?"
          ],
          [
            "We",
            "We want to talk.",
            "Do we want to talk?"
          ],
          [
            "They",
            "They want to wash.",
            "Do they want to wash?"
          ]
        ]
      },
